            <div xml:id="d351-a2">

                <pb facs="0538" n="444" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg444"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Affidavit of Deputy Sheriff Roberts.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Territory of Arizona</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">County of Pima, ss:</hi></p>
                <p>John W. Roberts, being by me first duly sworn, deposes and says:</p>
                <p>I am a deputy sheriff, residing at Nogales, Pima County, Arizona. I held the same
                    position during the year 1893 under Sheriff Scott, of Pima County, Arizona.</p>
                <p>On July 24th, 1893, in my official capacity, I arrested one Jesus Garcia for
                    fighting in the public street and took him before Justice E. K. Sykes. Said
                    arrest was made within the Territory of Arizona. Further deponent saith not.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. W. Roberts.</hi></signed></closer>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Subscribed and sworn to before me <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1896-01-09">this 9th day of January, A. D.
                            1896</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal.</hi>] <signed><hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">J. S. Taylor</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Notary Public.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
